## RDLC Enforcement

This repository uses claude-rdlc-wizard to enforce:

1. **Source discipline** — every claim has a citation; sources ranked by tier
2. **Confidence classification** — every claim labeled
3. **AI slop gate** — banned-phrase scan before commit
4. **Audience firewall** — per-deliverable boundaries enforced in generator
5. **Cross-model review** — adversarial validation for high-stakes deliverables
6. **Fact regression tests** — every defect becomes a permanent assertion

## Hooks Installed

| Hook | Trigger | Purpose |
|------|---------|---------|
| `rdlc-prompt-check.sh` | Every prompt | RDLC baseline reminder |
| `instructions-loaded-check.sh` | Session start | Validates RDLC.md exists |
| `slop-scan-pretool.sh` | Before Write/Edit | Blocks AI slop additions |
| `confidence-required.sh` | Before Write/Edit on `research/`, `evidence/` | Requires confidence label |
| `source-required.sh` | Before Write/Edit on research files | Requires source-at-first-mention |
| `audience-firewall.sh` | Before Write to `output/` | Blocks audience-private leaks |

