## Cross-Model Review Protocol

For high-stakes deliverables: pre-flight self-review → mission-first handoff → Codex xhigh review → dialogue loop (2-3 rounds) → CERTIFIED.

Full protocol: `~/xdlc/docs/cross-model-review.md` and `skills/rdlc/SKILL.md` "Cross-Model Review."

## Fact Regression Tests

Every defect becomes a permanent check.

Run: `bash scripts/regression_test.sh`

Pattern:
```bash
check_present "Claim X exists" "expected pattern" "$DOC"
check_absent "No fabrication Y" "forbidden pattern" "$DOC"
```

## Confidence Levels (For Tasks)

| Level | Action |
|-------|--------|
| HIGH (90%+) | Proceed after approval |
| MEDIUM (60-89%) | Highlight uncertainties |
| LOW (<60%) | ASK before proceeding |
| FAILED 2x | STOP and ASK |

